{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026r9N9Xs3xqm1794960252.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>京東集團第三季業績好過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>純利65億元人民幣，按年增加兩成三。經調整淨利潤83.2億元人民幣，上升逾四成三。期內收入則上升百分之3.5，至3,095億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>集團表示，季度取得穩健的業績表現，收入恢復正增長，利潤增速進一步提升，主要受惠於京東零售的韌性，以及新業務的持續減虧。季度用戶規模進一步擴大，營銷費用按年顯著下降，集團將繼續深耕現有市場，拓展國際版圖，為長期高質量增長奠定堅實基礎。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:03.406435+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T23:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:14.964982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:24.520800+00:00","content_hash":"55efa27e3c1f410fe07cc1dde300490697b62769322aee1cd51e0c87cfce01ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:03.406435+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}